WEBVTT

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.237
(Applause and cheers)

00:07:30.279 --> 00:07:31.405
So the next time ...

00:07:31.447 --> 00:07:33.699
(Applause)

00:07:33.741 --> 00:07:36.660
So the next time somebody tells you
to think outside the box,

00:07:36.702 --> 00:07:37.870
you can tell them,

00:07:37.912 --> 00:07:40.831
"Hey, this is not a box."

00:07:41.165 --> 00:07:43.375
Because when we remove our assumptions,

00:07:43.417 --> 00:07:46.545
we're able to then see
with this childlike sense of wonder.

00:07:46.587 --> 00:07:49.423
And that's the moment
when new ideas can enter the world.

00:07:49.465 --> 00:07:54.845
(Applause and cheers)